{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "The Next Step"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Website"}, {"type": "position", "content": 6}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 15}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.3"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "  Describe the reasons or results of events or actions in spoken or written texts, in work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn11le15ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Review: Simple Present, Present Continuous, Simple Future"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Let's review the uses of each of these verb tenses. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the <span class=\"underline\">Simple Present Tense</span>:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "1. to describe states"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">The group <span class=\"strong\">consists </span>of both old and new employees.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "(Other common state verbs are agree, assume, believe, cost, feel, hate, hope, have, know, like, look, love prefer, realize)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "2. to talk about the main events in a story"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">She <span class=\"strong\">goes up</span> to this man and <span class=\"strong\">asks </span>to borrow his car.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "3. to report what we have heard or said"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">I gather you have been to the meeting.</span>you have been to the meeting.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the <span class=\"underline\">Present Continuous Tense</span>:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "1. to talk about changes, developments and trends"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">The growing number of clients <span class=\"strong\">is putting</span> a strain on our resources.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "2. to talk about the background events in a story"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">She <span class=\"strong\">is heading</span> to the meeting and ...</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "3. to emphasize that something is done repeatedly"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">They'<span class=\"strong\">re always having </span>friends over on Friday nights.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the <span class=\"underline\">Simple Future</span> (will) to:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "1. to predict something will happen in the future"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"> I imagine the boardroom <span class=\"strong\">will </span> be full for the meeting.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "2. make a decision in the moment of speaking"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Ok, I<span class=\"strong\">'ll </span>start the meeting.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I don't know how to make a website so I'm interested to see how you did it."}, {"type": "example", "content": "People are adding resources all the time."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'll go through the steps with you."}, {"type": "example", "content": "There are already 150 million domain names out there."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm working on linking pages for the author bio and some social media safety information."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I think it will look great when it's all done. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " How to Create a Website"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Having a professional-looking website could be crucial to your business. What are the steps to creating a website?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ol><li>The first thing is to choose the website building platform that you will use for your site. </li><li>The next I thing I did was to choose a domain name and a hosting to represent the book and publisher.</li> <li>After you've installed your content management system you can choose a theme or a template and start adding your content, like images or text.</li><li>You can customize the templates any way you want so that they reflect what you want to communicate to your viewers. </li><li>You can add pages and link them to your navigation bar so you can group types of information. </li><li>You should also edit your page titles and taglines so that people searching for your site can easily find it.</li></ol>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "perplexing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "confusing and uncertain"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It sounds perplexing already."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le15ob06aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about work and building a website."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "user-friendly"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "easy to use and understand"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: New content management systems like Word Press are very user-friendly. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le15ob06aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "domain name"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the \u200bpart of an \u200bemail or \u200bwebsite \u200baddress giving the \u200bname of the \u200borganization the \u200baddress \u200bbelongs to"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The next I thing I did was to choose a domain name and a hosting to represent the book and publisher."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le15ob06aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "per"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "for each"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: On Word Press these cost about $4 per month. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le15ob06aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "brandable"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "unique; able to be marketed "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You need to think up a brandable and catchy domain name."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le15ob06aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "catchy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "instantly appealing and memorable"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: A catchy slogan is one that sticks in your mind."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le15ob06aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to customize"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to modify something to suit a particular individual or task"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can customize the templates any way you want so that they reflect what you want to communicate to your viewers."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le15ob06aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Surf the internet and look at different types of websites."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you find one that appeals to you, look at it in more detail."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make notes about what you like about the website."}, {"type": "text", "content": "If there is anything that you would change, make a note of it."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a paragraph describing the website and why you think it is good."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your paragraph to your class or group."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I surf the internet and look at different websites."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I look in detail at a website that I like."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a paragraph about wha